  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your wrath is endless against your hated foes</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Extended Bane<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your Wisdom bonus and your mythic tier to the number of rounds per day that you can use your bane ability. In addition, when you confirm a critical hit against a creature whose type matches your bane, you gain an additional number of rounds of bane equal to your weapon’s critical multiplier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc130\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
